## How to run (once ClickHouse profile exists)
```bash
cd dbt
cp profiles.example.yml ~/.dbt/profiles.yml   # edit host/user/password
dbt deps
dbt seed
dbt run --select +mart_emonc_curriculum_completion +mart_individual_mentee_emonc_curriculum_progress +mart_newborn_curriculum_completion +metrics
dbt test --select mart_emonc_curriculum_completion mart_individual_mentee_emonc_curriculum_progress mart_newborn_curriculum_completion
```

## Non-goals for this pass
- Do not modify live SQL artifacts (`mentee_curriculum_completion_progress`,
  `newborn_curriculum_completion_progress`, etc.).
- Do not require a live ClickHouse connection to review/edit models.
- Do not explode full Kobo JSON yet — stub staging + seed-backed completion path first.
